\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]five sections plus a collapsed Capture protocol section; `bob task [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]{archive,reconcile,reroll}` and `bob pomodoro {notify,status,tmux}`[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]replace five opaque top-level names; every old spelling keeps [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]working forever as a silent alias with byte-identical behavior; and[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the README, docs, tests, chezmoi, and bob-plugins all teach the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]canonical names.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob_command_tree.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/bob_command_tree.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-46[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-46/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Sectioned help, help routing, and completion parity[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sectioned-help[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sectioned-help: replace CompletionTier with workflow Sections, render [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sectioned root help (-h collapses the capture protocol, --help lists [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]it), cut the examples, add the argv alias-rewrite table and `bob help [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]<path>` routing, hide `freshness seed`, label defaults, group `bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]<TAB>` by section, and amend cli_rules.md. No command changes behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob task and bob pomodoro groups with permanent aliases[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]command-groups[dim] · [dim][/dim]after sectioned-help[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]command-groups: add Leaf/Group targets to the runner table, route `bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task` and `bob pomodoro` (bare = status), map the five old names onto [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]canonical paths as silent aliases, print canonical names in every leaf's[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]help, diagnostics, logs, and commit subjects, mount the groups in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion, and add alias-parity, routing, and help snapshot tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]README, docs, and tests teach the canonical names[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]canonical-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after command-groups[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]canonical-docs: rewrite the README command reference, task and Pomodoro [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sections, shims table, and migration notes; move docs/ to canonical [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]spellings; migrate test invocations to canonical paths; and record the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]proposed follow-ups.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]chezmoi and bob-plugins callers move to canonical names[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]downstream-callers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after command-groups[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]downstream-callers: switch the chezmoi shims, tmux.conf, and obsidian [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory note to canonical names, fix the stale highlights-ref message, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]retire the stale bob_dataview skill copies, update the bob-plugins [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notice string, and guard the rollout so no host runs new spellings on an[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]old bob.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-46","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":